Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:07.03,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,The entire world is white.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:19.29,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:24.51,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,That's right. I've been here with her all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:28.05,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I've been here with only her...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:32.10,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,...in this sad world where there is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:56.67,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
