Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:07.52,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf27}bo{\kf21}ku {\kf40}hi{\kf45}to{\kf43}ri {\kf85}ga {\kf24}ko{\kf22}ko {\kf43}de {\kf35}ya{\kf41}sa{\kf41}shi{\kf55}i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:07.52,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm standing here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:15.19,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:15.19,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}remembering all the heart-warming memories.
