Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:22.87,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:29.08,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:29.08,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:36.84,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:36.84,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:43.80,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:43.80,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:46.10,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf14}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf23}ma{\kf21}de{\kf22}mo {\kf14}o{\kf26}bo{\kf25}e{\kf23}te{\kf20}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:46.10,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.93,0:01:48.22,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.93,0:01:48.22,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.43,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.43,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.18,0:01:52.94,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.18,0:01:52.94,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:56.90,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:56.90,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:02.15,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:02.15,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:15.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Final Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:15.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Small Palms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:23.21,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,If this was going to happen,\NI shouldn't have brought her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.17,0:02:27.21,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I only brought her suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:29.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:34.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't have spoken to Nagisa at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:37.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If she hadn't met me, Nagisa wouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:47.32,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Is this the end of our journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.36,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I didn't want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:57.79,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I didn't want her to go to sleep in such a cold place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:31.03,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.70,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You're there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:41.91,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Of course. I'm always by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:43.62,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:45.33,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.34,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I can finally hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:49.84,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:55.34,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I soon won't be a human, so I can hear your voice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.76,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I was having a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:01.56,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I learned a lot of things in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.19,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,About myself. About you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:06.19,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Will you listen to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:07.61,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.69,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You and I used to be in the same world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.61,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We were very close, too. Long ago, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:19.12,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Actually, we might still be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.25,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,So we weren't supposed to be in this world, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.62,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Let's go back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:29.88,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I have to remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.21,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:36.43,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Because, in this world, I am {\i1}the{\i0} world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:40.76,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I don't understand! We promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.81,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We promised we'd leave this world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:47.19,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,If I leave this world, this world will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.98,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Then many lights would meet misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.15,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:55.28,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,You mean all those lights that were flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:05:00.66,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yes. Those are feelings from people in the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.58,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You were one of the lights, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:08.58,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,The world that is furthest, yet the world that is closest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:12.21,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We've always been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:15.47,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yes, we came from the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.97,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We only see things differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:22.47,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Another world? Is an alternate me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:24.81,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You should be able to tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:28.81,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,since you exist in both worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:34.82,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We were able to meet despite the differences in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.49,0:05:37.20,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That's enough to make me content.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:45.16,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You will soon fall asleep in this world and wake up in the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:48.62,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You'll meet many people, and many things will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.83,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Then you'll eventually meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:52.79,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:54.21,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,In the other world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:59.01,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Like we can see people's feelings from the other world as light in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:04.51,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,my feelings will become many lights in that world and shimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:14.27,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Each light may be very faint, but gathered together should become a strong force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:23.74,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I know that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:27.50,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yes. It's the song you always sang for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.68,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Good bye, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:11.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:19.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:24.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:26.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm glad you stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:35.98,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:44.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I was really worried you might be thinking that you should never have met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:51.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I had a wonderful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:59.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So please, don't lose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:08.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No matter what may await,\Nplease don't regret meeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:22.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Would you like me to take you? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,To a place in this city where wishes come true. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's coming to an end...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...The long, long journey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:37.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:47.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:54.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We were just together, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We're always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:04.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We said that we'd always be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:10.55,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:13.89,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Both the baby and your wife are safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.47,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,You've done a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:18.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You did great, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:27.36,Default,San,0,0,0,,Will you give Ushio her first bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:30.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.99,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Support the head with your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.25,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Plug the ears so water doesn't get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.96,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Yes, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.42,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,There, doesn't it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.84,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Don't dip the head in yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:47.34,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Wipe it with the gauze.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:51.80,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan, isn't it great to be washed by your Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:55.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Great job, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.18,Default,San,0,0,0,,She's a very active baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:00.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I hope she'll continue to be active even after she grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:01.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:05.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She'll be a strong girl, in both body and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:06.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll make sure of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:14.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. Take a look outside the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You mean the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:40.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:44.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango, a great big dango family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:50.07,Default,2,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:53.41,Default,2,0,0,0,,A great big dango family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:12:02.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If a city has a heart and a mind like people do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:09.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,and if it's trying to make the people living in it as happy as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:13.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,then a miracle like this could be something the city accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:32.24,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1824,48)}{\be1\K30}{\K127}To{\K41}o{\K10}{\K34}ku {\K161}de{\K99} {\K121}to{\K78}o{\K43}ku {\K77}de{\K47} {\K29}yu{\K24}re{\K9}{\K61}te{\K55}ru{\K63} {\K52}i{\K36}na{\K148}ho {\K57}no {\K34}u{\K354}mi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1824,120)}{\be1}Far, far away is a sea of rice swaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:19.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But that's not exactly a miracle, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The people that love the city live there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:26.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,and the city that loves people will love the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:31.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's something that should be happening anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:51.05,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\be1\pos(1824,48)\K30}{\K73}Ho {\K99}wo {\K39}a{\K114}ge{\K157} {\K54}ho {\K79}wo{\K37} {\K66}a{\K68}ge{\K46} {\K30}me{\K29}za{\K65}shi{\K75}ta{\K51} {\K54}o{\K39}mo{\K144}i{\K60}de {\K32}he{\K314}to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:51.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\be1\pos(1824,120)}Cast, cast off, and sail to where the memories are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:38.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We love the city, and we're being nurtured by the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:42.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The city is a big family, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. Just like Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:47.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think I finally understand, too.
