Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:53.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500)}{\be1\pos(1824,120)}The special day is the start of a new season.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:23.72,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Don't be so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:25.76,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko is very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:28.51,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That person was very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:30.72,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko isn't a grade school kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:34.98,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You're very small, so you can't blame them for the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:39.48,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Even if Fuko's small, Fuko wants them to sense the adult aura Fuko gives off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:43.78,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You're not giving that off as much as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:47.87,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That really stabbed into Fuko's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:49.78,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:52.16,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's been tainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:54.00,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Don't say strange thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:56.12,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's an adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.92,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe it's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:02.51,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,How you speak in the third person may be the reason people see you as a child. {This came at the VERY end of the game, and it was like ep7 or so that I realized. Remember how we overhauled all her "I"s to "Fuko"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:04.88,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,How should Fuko speak then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.51,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,"Me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.97,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You know, me's already mature enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:11.97,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:13.98,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That was so illicit sounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:17.31,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Don't jab at your own action.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.61,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Just say "I" like everyone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:22.65,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,"I"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:26.99,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You know, I'm already mature enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.99,0:17:28.11,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:29.87,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That was so illicit sounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:33.49,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I think it would sound illicit no matter how you say it so long as it's that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.91,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:37.71,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,So you've given up already, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:40.67,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko wants to go to a family restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:43.21,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Let's go after the check up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:46.01,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with Fuko anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:48.84,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,So we're going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:49.47,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.47,0:17:53.18,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, the hamburgers will be sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:55.56,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,There are plenty, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:18:00.98,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It would be gone if everyone's been ordering only hamburgers starting last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.86,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Such a coincidence can't happen, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:07.32,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,There, we're almost at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.36,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,If the hamburgers are sold out, I'll make one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:13.33,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Will it be served on an iron plate so it won't get cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:15.12,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,It will, it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.00,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Then okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:24.38,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Besides, even if you're physically all right,\Nwe need to periodically check your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:29.38,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'll be at ease if they tell me that you're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:29.88,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.93,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's making you worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.89,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,No, not that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:41.48,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Please dissect Fuko all you want so you'll be at ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:42.90,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Fu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:46.03,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Onee-chan! You're a slow walker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:48.03,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Let's move along!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:49.90,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Why is she like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.75,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,What is it this time, Fu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.62,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko can smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:02.83,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,The smell of a hamburger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:05.09,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Don't treat me the same as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:08.71,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I was trying to talk at the same level as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.30,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That was very rude of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:13.72,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko will repeat, so please ask what Fuko smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:14.93,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:16.68,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko can smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:18.22,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,What do you smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.85,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,This smell is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:22.81,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's a cute smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:25.31,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,That's not really an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.69,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko was hoping you would catch the nuance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:28.94,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Was it a riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:31.20,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You're being rude. It's an art.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:33.82,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You're talking more nonsense again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:35.53,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you're saying, Fu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:39.54,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You were a teacher, so you're too much of a realist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.54,0:19:42.58,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I was an art teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.46,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:44.29,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:47.25,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Then please capture what Fuko says.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:49.46,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,There's nothing to capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.72,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.18,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Then Fuko will say it simply.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:56.30,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,I'll repeat again, so ask Fuko what the smell is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.05,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:19:58.76,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Someone's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:19:59.60,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:01.18,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That's not what you're supposed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.81,0:20:03.60,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,The statement changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:06.69,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to ask,\N"What do you smell?" to that statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.69,0:20:07.82,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:10.23,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,That would make me a strange person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:13.20,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Fuko will follow you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.62,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:16.66,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:18.58,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Someone's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:20.29,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,What do you smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:23.04,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's here to meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:26.38,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You didn't follow me up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:29.38,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Why aren't you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:32.22,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko said someone's here to meet Fuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:36.43,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I hope she'll make lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.39,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:39.97,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:41.56,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Someone's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:43.23,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,What do you smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:46.27,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's here to meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:48.44,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:50.61,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's a cute smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.07,0:20:53.28,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:55.32,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,She's sleeping there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.03,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,She's waiting to be woken by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:59.20,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.54,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.54,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Fu-chan! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:09.29,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You should come fast if you want to meet her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:11.13,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,She's under that tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:12.80,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:14.47,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko doesn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:17.55,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,But she's a very cute girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:18.89,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Fu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:20.39,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Hey, Fu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:24.06,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Really, she's such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.57,0:21:38.20,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Are you there? It's Fuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.33,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.42,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Would you tell Fuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:55.84,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Let's be friends and play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:22:02.14,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,The fun is only just about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\4c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\pos(1635,783)}End
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.78,0:23:47.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even as a junior, it took me a lot of time to become friends with my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But you're alone in the class like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:54.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't talk with anyone, so I was a little lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:00.88,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It'll be nice if you can make friends in your class soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:01.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.22,0:24:06.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It was my first time talking to her,\Nso I was a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Extra Episode
